{"slug":"laravel-api-ahthentication","title":"Laravel 框架学习——多表 api 认证","date":"2019-09-01","tags":["PHP","Laravel"],"category":"Server-side","excerpt":"Laravel提供了API认证，但是只支持一张表，如何完成多表API认证呢","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1,"contentHtml":"<blockquote>\n<p>根据Laravel官方文档：<a href=\"https://laravel.com/docs/6.0/api-authentication\">api认证</a>\r\n<code>api</code>认证支持<code>Eloquent</code>与<code>database</code>方式，我这里的配置选用的是<code>database</code>方式</p>\n</blockquote>\n<img src=\"https://laravel.com/img/logotype.min.svg\"/>\n<h2 id=\"单表api认证\">单表api认证</h2>\n<h3 id=\"数据库\">数据库</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>表名：<code>user</code></li>\n<li>字段：<code>api_token</code>为必须，其它自选</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"configauthphp\">config/auth.php</h4>\n<h3 id=\"auth-php\">auth-php</h3>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>'guards' => [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        'api' => [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            'driver' => 'token',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            'provider' => 'users',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            'hash' => false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>'providers' => [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        'users' => [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            'driver' => 'database',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            'table' => 'user'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>]</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">php</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"多表api认证\">多表api认证</h2>\n<h3 id=\"新增中间件\">新增中间件</h3>\n<p>运行</p>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">php</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> artisan</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> make:middleware</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> EmployeeToken</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<p>该命令会在<code>App\\Http\\Middleware</code>目录下新增一个<code>EmployeeToken.php</code>文件</p>\n<h3 id=\"注册路由中间件\">注册路由中间件</h3>\n<p>在<code>App\\Http\\Kernel</code>类中：</p>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>protected $routeMiddleware = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 其它中间件...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  'employeeToken' => \\App\\Http\\Middleware\\EmployeeToken::class,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 其它中间件...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>];</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">php</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"中间件代码\">中间件代码</h3>\n<p>EmployeeToken的代码如下</p>\n<h3 id=\"middleware-php\">middleware-php</h3>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;?php</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>namespace App\\Http\\Middleware;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use Closure;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\DB;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class EmployeeToken</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /**</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     * Handle an incoming request.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     *</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     * @param  \\Illuminate\\Http\\Request  $request</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     * @param  \\Closure  $next</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     * @return mixed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public function handle($req, Closure $next)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        $api_token = $req->input('api_token');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if($api_token == null){</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          return response()->json([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            'Token无效！'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          ]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        $couriers = DB::select('SELECT * FROM employee WHERE api_token = ?', [ $api_token ]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if(count($couriers) != 1){</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          return response()->json([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            'Token无效！'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          ]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // api_token转换到courier表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        $req->setUserResolver(function() use ($couriers){</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          return $couriers[0];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return $next($req);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">php</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>检查请求输入参数<code>api_token</code>是否存在</li>\n<li>并检查在表<code>employee </code>中是否存在<code>api_token</code>=输入参数<code>api_token</code>的记录</li>\n<li>不存在则直接返回json，附带错误信息</li>\n<li>通过<code>setUserResolver</code>方法，传递一个闭包，使得<code>Request</code>的<code>user()</code>方法返回<code>employee</code>表中<code>api_token</code>=输入参数的<code>api_token</code>的一条记录</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"指定路由使用中间件\">指定路由使用中间件</h3>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Route::middleware('employeeToken')->prefix('employee')->group(function(){</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">php</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><code>/api/employee/**/*</code>路由都使用<code>employeeToken</code></li>\n<li>在<code>/api/employee/**/*</code>下路由对应的<code>Controller</code>中直接使用<code>request->user()</code>方法即可获取对应的访问<code>employee</code>表记录</li>\n</ul>","related":[{"slug":"laravel-preview","title":"Laravel框架学习 - 概览","date":"2019-08-15","tags":["PHP","Laravel"],"category":"Server-side","excerpt":"预览Laravel框架","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1},{"slug":"how-to-modify-external-param-with-a-closure-in-php","title":"PHP中如何在匿名函数中修改外部变量","date":"2019-11-21","tags":["PHP"],"category":"Server-side","excerpt":"在PHP中使用闭包时，会遇到需要修改闭包外部的变量操作，这时该如何操作呢？","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1},{"slug":"how-to-buid-vuecli3-project-to-war","title":"将Vue-cli3.0搭建的前端项目构建并打包成war文件","date":"2019-10-05","tags":["Vue","Tomcat","Java"],"category":"Server-side","excerpt":"公司新项目采用前后分离，前端Vue，后端SpringBoot，部署平台只接受war包，需求就是把前端build之后的资源打成war包","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1}]}